OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of showery rain. The rain
OL,7,Fwill clear Shetland by late morning
OL,8,Fand Orkney by early afternoon, leaving
OL,9,Fbright spells with scattered afternoon
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FScattered evening showers
OL,13,Fwill be interspersed with the
OL,14,Foccasional clear spell. These showers
OL,15,Fwill continue overnight, easing for a
OL,16,Ftime towards the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
