OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry, bright at first but
OL,6,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,7,Fshowers soon spread southeast. These
OL,8,Fshowers become less frequent from late
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,12,Fwith blustery and wintry showers
OL,13,FThursday. Less cold with showery rain
OL,14,FFriday becoming breezy with increasing
OL,15,Foutbreaks of showery rain Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
